message: "If you use Chronokairo AXIOM in your academic research or applications, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Chronokairo AXIOM: Mathematical Reasoning Engine with Independent Verification and Domain Integrity"
abstract: "AXIOM is a neuro-symbolic mathematical reasoning engine designed for autonomous coding agents. It unifies Computer Algebra Systems (SymPy, mpmath), Interactive Theorem Provers (Lean 4, Mathlib4), and a strict six-level mathematical guarantee hierarchy over the Model Context Protocol (MCP) and deterministic CLI."
